{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>烏克蘭指俄軍襲擊住宅大廈，可能有多人被困。</p><p></p><p>烏克蘭總統澤連斯基表示，俄羅斯無人機周日上午，襲擊烏克蘭首都基輔，一座五層高的住宅大廈，造成大廈部分倒塌，兩人受傷，至少有14人可能困在瓦礫。</p><p></p><p>俄方則表示用無人機打擊了為烏軍服務的能源設施，港口基礎設施和船隻，俄羅斯防空部隊在多地擊落了170架烏克蘭無人機。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T13:23:52.195737+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T12:13:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T13:37:12.152968+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T13:17:17.256631+00:00","content_hash":"c3cdf59aecd4cdf74b135be9ae3f03ffd64937121d30cb3a424bedb9ff8abd37","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T13:23:52.195737+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}